apns.h1_f:
POST https://api.push.apple.com/3/device/<device_token>
Pane: apns-kaupapa: <bundle_id>, apns-push-type: mataara, apns-collapse-id: ruma:42
Tinana: {aps: {matohi: {title, body}}, raraunga: <hiritia>}

bmp.h1_f:
mailbox_id = HKDF(recipient_pubkey, info="bmp-v1", len=32)
Putunga: POST /bmp/putunga {mailbox_id, blob ≤1MB}
Tikina: GET /bmp/messages (whakaarohia)

